    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d289">

                <pb facs="0368" n="350" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg350"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.00/6–2046: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Adam</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-06-20T15:00:00-04:00">June 20, 1946—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:46 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>564. Had long and serious talk last night with Pinto and Paz Estenssoro. They
                    told me Aranibar has his freedom only because the President ordered it done as a
                    personal favor to me. They consider that as long as he is in his position he is
                    a threat to the stability of the Government. Under these circumstances he will
                    have to be removed to another country when the Grace vice president gets
                    here.</p>
                <p>They stated emphatically that United States press services would have to be
                    represented here by other than Bolivian citizens.</p>
                <pb facs="0369" n="351" xml:id="pg351"/>
                <p>The Dept may wish to inform AP and UP of this situation with such recommendations as
                    seem best to it. AP services have been shut down
                    and none of their despatches appear in today’s <hi rendition="#italic">La
                        Razón.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adam</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
